// VertexLitGeneric's extra blended passes, each over a base pass that the
// legacy port draws ($detail selects a combo only the port draws): the
// emissive scroll pass ($emissiveblendenabled), the cloak pass
// ($cloakpassenabled; the frame buffer it refracts is a solid color here),
// the weapon sheen pass ($sheenpassenabled, each mask direction and effect)
// and the flesh interior pass ($fleshinteriorenabled). Cube maps are point
// sampled (Vulkan filters cube maps across faces, D3D9 within one).
